Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:02.94,Main,Students,0000,0000,0000,,Supplementary classes for a month?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:05.85,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently it was just \Ndecided at a staff meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:09.23,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,If there's even one failing grade \Non our proficiency tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:11.61,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,the whole class has to take \Nsupplementary classes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:12.64,Main,Students,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.64,0:00:14.38,Main,Students,0000,0000,0000,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:23.81,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,What should we do? We're \Nin a bind, Masamune-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.81,0:00:26.13,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, we're gonna have to work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:28.45,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it'll be easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:32.38,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Nah. The people who really \Nhave it easy are... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:34.59,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,They look like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:40.55,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You don't look worried at all about \Nthe proficiency test, Kojuurou.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:42.85,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. We need to work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:46.90,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,I only managed single-digit grades \Nin all subjects on our midterms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:49.61,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hoping to get double-digit \Ngrades this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.83,0:00:52.57,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I had no idea he was that stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.57,0:00:55.01,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Kojuurou-kyun is bound for \Nthe supplementary classes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:59.37,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,If he ends up losing even more weight \Nand becomes more of a bottom, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:01:01.58,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Hold up. You're into that stuff, Futaba-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:04.92,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Well, {\i1}otokonoko{\i0} (boys) and {\i1}otokonoko{\i0} \N(traps) are two different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:08.83,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,They're the same word, but I can tell you \Nmean them in totally different ways!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.39,0:01:12.09,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to take supplementary classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:14.36,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.26,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to start studying \Nright now, Kojuurou!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:20.76,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, what? Where are you \Ntwo going to hole up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.13,0:01:22.79,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Stop making up weird fantasies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.53,Study Hall,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Study Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:58.03,Kanji,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Four-Character Kanji Compounds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:58.03,Modern Literature,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Modern Literature
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:58.03,English Essay Training,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,English Essay Training
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:03:01.74,Episode Title,Title,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(483,473)}#3 "Yoshino's Magic Show"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:00.28,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}First, I have to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.65,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}what you know and what you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.65,0:03:04.62,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,There's no point in starting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:07.33,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,How did you even get into this school?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:09.88,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,It's apparently one of the seven wonders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:11.54,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck are the other six?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.95,0:03:14.92,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,It really is amazing that we \Nended up in the same school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.26,0:03:17.57,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}It's apparently one of the seven wonders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.57,0:03:19.28,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}What are the other six?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:21.01,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,They're having a similar \Nconversation right next to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:29.98,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey, what a coincidence. \NAre you two studying for a test, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:32.76,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I was just helping out Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:35.19,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,If the rumors are true, we'll end \Nup in supplementary classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:36.89,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.19,0:03:40.40,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,She seems like she should be smart, \Nbut her grades are that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:44.51,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like we're in the \Nsame boat, Koiwai-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.51,0:03:46.87,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe-kun's teaching me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:49.41,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Wow. I'm surprised that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:51.83,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,you're able to teach anyone anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.83,0:03:54.50,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I study when I need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:57.03,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I see you're as overconfident as ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.03,0:03:59.21,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,despite falling for something so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:03.18,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Hopefully you won't trip up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.35,0:04:08.51,Flashback,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,If you leave things to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.51,0:04:11.89,Flashback,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,you could exchange email addresses \Nand go on dates all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:16.34,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,If you're going to say all that, \Nwhy don't we make a wager?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:17.12,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:19.77,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be a contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:21.15,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Will it be me and Kojuurou
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:24.24,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,or you and Koiwai-san that scores\Nhigher on the proficiency test?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:30.20,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,If I win, go on a date with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.57,0:04:32.08,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,M-Makabe-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:35.21,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Why would it even come to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:37.67,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Not feeling so confident now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:40.05,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:43.32,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, what's in it for me if \NI do participate in that wager?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:45.59,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,If you win, Adagaki-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:47.68,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,you can give me whatever \Nnickname you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.18,Black Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Pig's Foot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:51.18,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I'll stick that nickname on my back
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:55.02,Edit,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Pig's Foot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:54.66,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,and go through high school with \Nit on my back until I graduate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:57.55,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that sounds entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.88,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,But that won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:05.11,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,If I win, you'll have to pay for \Nmy lunch until I say it's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:07.00,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.21,0:05:14.54,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Don't come crying to me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:18.39,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,M-Makabe-kun, I'm not sure about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:19.89,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:22.42,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,If what she said was true,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:25.96,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,this won't be two against two, \Nbut three against one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:34.51,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Aki-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:38.23,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you need to study?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:41.51,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you suggesting that I'd lose to Makabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.51,0:05:44.69,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,No, but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:49.07,Main,Yoshno,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that he got a perfect \Nscore on the transfer exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.65,0:05:51.83,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,He did?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:55.06,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,He's apparently the first person \Nto do that at our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:58.64,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I thought he was just some gross\Nnarcissist... That's why I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:05:59.81,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.81,0:06:01.84,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I will support you all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:04.49,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,but if it comes down to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:07.88,Guidebook,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Guidebook
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.56,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,please use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:14.77,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,"If it comes down to it"? \NThis is never going to happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.87,0:06:18.38,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, you just need to study!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:20.70,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll support you as much as you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:22.56,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:25.15,Black Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Koiwai Yoshino
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:24.75,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:29.29,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Come to think of it, this is the \Nfirst time I've ever called a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:32.87,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Am I okay with Koiwai-san being my first?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:37.46,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,But if I don't call her now, I won't be \Nable to talk to her about the bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:39.46,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,But then again...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.54,Koiwai Yoshino,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Incoming Call\NKoiwai Yoshino
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.89,0:06:42.72,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,She's calling!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:45.10,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-Should I answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:49.93,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Am I okay with giving my first time \Nbeing called by a girl to Koiwai-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:51.22,Koiwai Yoshino02,,0000,0000,0000,,Incoming Call\NKoiwai Yoshino
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:56.18,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever! H-Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.71,0:06:57.93,Italics,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,You take too long to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:07:01.77,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Well, as a guy, I needed to prepare myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:05.69,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so about the wager, \Nyou'll help me out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.47,0:07:07.07,Italics,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:08.03,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:10.74,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you suddenly make \Na decision like that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:12.74,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,on your own, I have my own timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:15.70,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a sec! But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:18.58,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? "Don't make the people live, \Nbut don't kill them"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.50,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Are we talking about Tokugawa Ieyasu here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:22.85,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,How could this... Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:25.88,Black Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs18}Math Test
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:25.88,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry, Makabe-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:29.34,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm doing my best to study, \Nbut if all else fails,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.34,0:07:30.80,Black Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Great General Designated Bottom
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:32.94,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have her give me an \Nembarrassing nickname, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:33.26,Great General,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Great General Designated Bottom
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:33.26,Pig's Foot,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Pig's Foot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:35.97,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,No, you don't need to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.35,0:07:46.73,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,When was the Crimean War?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.73,0:07:48.23,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,1853.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:51.99,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of cell division occurs \Nin order for gametes to form?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:53.11,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Meiosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:54.62,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,"I even cough alone."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:55.67,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Ozaki Housai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:56.74,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,What's the Earth's mass?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.03,0:08:00.46,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,5.972 × 10^24 kilograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:02.46,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,What is a way to say "Your mom \Nhas an outie" in English?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.46,0:08:03.71,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:09.75,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, we're about even.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:12.60,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I need to put more pressure \Non her, or we're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.71,0:08:17.18,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,At this point, it's going to come \Ndown to our own abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:08:58.47,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:01.67,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-chan's actually studying \Ninstead of working out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:04.54,Main,Kinue,0000,0000,0000,,Maa-kun said he has a very \Nimportant test tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:05.69,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:09.65,Main,Kinue,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thinking about making \NMaa-kun's lunch tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:12.61,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,It has to be low in calories, \Nhigh in protein, with no grease.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.85,0:09:15.13,Main,Kinue,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go all-out and make a \Ncharacter-themed lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:17.32,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I want one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:21.04,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever. Even without Koiwai-san's help,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:23.35,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I just have to win tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:33.36,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Kojuurou, do you think you'll make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:36.68,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,For now. It's all thanks to you, Makabe-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:40.89,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Now all we have left \Nis math in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:44.89,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I was extra attentive in teaching him math, \Nso we should have a good chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:47.31,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe-kun, let's eat lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:49.73,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,I used my head too much, and now I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:52.36,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. I'll go buy some drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.15,0:10:05.20,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:07.33,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:09.83,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,It was weird of me to rely on you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:13.75,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,for a fight I decided to undertake myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:18.35,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,And as a result, I got tons of studying in,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:21.41,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,so Kojuurou and I are both in top form today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:22.64,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,We're not gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:24.90,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:29.62,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Drink that, and do your best \Non the rest of the tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:31.99,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,But you can't help me out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:33.82,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Should you be cheering me on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:36.03,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:43.41,Black Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Mommy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:47.68,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:50.08,Chalkboard,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Test\NMath
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:53.29,Main,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Stay focused until the very end, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:54.40,Main,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.72,0:10:59.72,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Good. These are all questions \NI anticipated. Now I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:04.36,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I think... my...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:06.14,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,stomach hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:10.10,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,This pain... Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:11.86,Flashback,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:13.81,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Did she actually mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:16.88,Italics,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter, because I made \Nthe necessary preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:18.53,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Is that what she meant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:22.00,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,She must've put laxatives or \Nsomething in that coffee,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.00,0:11:23.74,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,as an assassin for Adagaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:25.92,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:28.20,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Adagaki Aki and Koiwai Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:30.57,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You're both my enemies after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.57,0:11:33.67,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you do something so low just \Nbecause you can't win otherwise?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.91,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You won't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:41.87,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:42.99,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:57.07,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:03.02,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,M-Makabe-kun? Oh, my...\NDid you need something from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:05.87,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Er, uh, I was looking for Adagaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:09.31,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Adagaki-san? She's not here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:09.96,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:12.83,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently she's out with a fever. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:14.14,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:16.45,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.95,0:12:19.23,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Does that mean we had already won
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:21.76,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,by the time that happened earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:24.18,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Then why would she give me laxatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.39,0:12:32.60,Italics,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-chan, did you eat the \Nlunch that Mom made?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.39,0:12:34.10,Messages,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Messages
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.39,0:12:34.10,Sister,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.39,0:12:34.10,Edit,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\3c&H5B4724&\an9\pos(544,118)}Edit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:35.35,Italics,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,The eggs in the omelet \Nwere bad. It was so sour!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:38.07,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,That stupid old hag...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:43.24,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe-kun, do your best in \Nthe supplementary class!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:45.45,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:47.41,Supplementary,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Supplementary Class
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:50.43,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,How am I the only one that has \Nto take supplementary classes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:02.76,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,There's a method where you \Nfind the common factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:06.01,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,It can be "x" or, as you see here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.01,0:13:07.59,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,it could be the function where
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.87,0:13:09.01,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:11.34,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,the factor is inside the parentheses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.77,0:13:12.59,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,this sort of counts as a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.00,0:13:17.38,Main,girlA,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:18.98,Main,girlB,0000,0000,0000,,He looks so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.48,0:13:22.66,Main,girlB,0000,0000,0000,,But with that look, he must be going on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.99,0:13:24.95,Flashback,masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? A date?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:28.16,Flashback,masamune,0000,0000,0000,,But didn't that wager end in a draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:31.44,Flashback,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,The fact that you're giving up \Nthere is your flaw, Pig's Foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:33.03,Flashback Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me Pig's Foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.03,0:13:34.59,Flashback,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Sunday at noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.59,0:13:37.12,Flashback,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,You'll meet up at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:39.80,Flashback Italics,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Aki-sama will definitely show up. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.35,0:13:41.27,Flashback,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:45.80,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,If what she said on the phone was true,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:48.07,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,then at long last...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.01,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,Adagaki Aki and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:53.33,Main,PersonA,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, look at how she's dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:56.48,Main,PersonB,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell? Is that for a \Npart-time job or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:02.74,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Adagaki Aki is standing where \Nwe're supposed to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:06.15,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,and wearing a transformation \Nmagical girl cosplay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.51,0:14:09.58,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,It's that one show. The anime that \Nused to be on Sunday mornings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:10.76,Main,Otaku,0000,0000,0000,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:13.54,Main,Otaku,0000,0000,0000,,can I get a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:15.16,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Wh-Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:17.30,Main,Otaku,0000,0000,0000,,It's really well-made!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.30,0:14:19.46,Main,Otaku,0000,0000,0000,,You're cosplaying Whitening-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:21.99,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I-I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:23.12,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Adagaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.67,0:14:25.43,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,M-Makabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.43,0:14:28.17,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.17,0:14:30.14,Main,Otaku,0000,0000,0000,,Tch. 3D girls are so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.86,0:14:34.36,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,This is why I hate disgusting men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:36.00,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I give you the nickname
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:38.64,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,"Acidic Cleanser and Rag." \N"Acid Rag" for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:41.61,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,The fact that it sounds less threatening \Nwhen you shorten it is frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.03,0:14:45.31,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, the menace is gone now. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.31,0:14:47.49,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You're not gonna explain \Nwhy you're dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.93,0:14:48.85,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.31,0:14:51.36,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.36,0:14:53.60,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You look rather experienced,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:56.00,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,but you don't even know \Nthe dress code for dates?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:57.20,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:15:01.02,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,To break the ice on the first date, \Nwearing a costume is a given.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:03.17,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,That's the most basic of basic rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:05.38,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:08.85,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,How does the Cruel Princess \Nend up like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:10.13,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Koiwai Yoshino?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.37,0:15:13.32,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you were the Fairy Godmother \Nrather than Cinderella!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:17.51,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I told you. Timing is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:21.15,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,If you leave it to me, everything \Nwill go according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:24.51,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I obey all of Aki-sama's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.51,0:15:26.96,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,That's why Aki-sama believes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.96,0:15:28.72,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,everything I say and do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:31.11,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,She'll easily believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:33.56,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,So if she were to use this \Nservant-master relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:36.48,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,against her, it'd be the ultimate deceit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.48,0:15:37.44,Italics,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:38.77,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:42.96,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Or rather, why are you \Ngoing so far to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.82,0:15:47.61,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,If I stay on the line too long, \NAki-sama will get suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:48.92,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:51.17,Italics,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, do your best, Pig's Foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:53.51,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Anything but that nickname, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.73,0:15:58.59,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,At any rate, I'm going to use this date and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.59,0:16:00.89,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,this derpy cosplay to my advantage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:04.47,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I guess I didn't research enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.47,0:16:06.77,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,So there's a dress code for first dates, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:08.19,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,See? Like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:10.07,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,But I guess that means you admit
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.07,0:16:12.44,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,that this is a date, Adagaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:15.07,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.07,0:16:18.17,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,This is all because your mental\Nfortitude is soft as tofu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.17,0:16:19.20,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:22.10,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Because you failed your test, \Nyou couldn't even eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:24.63,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,so you burst out crying in class, \Nand in the nurse's office,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:27.74,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,they caught you hiding a bunch of \Nwrist-cutting attempts with your sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.74,0:16:30.50,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,When Yoshino told me the\Nwhole story and said that only I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.50,0:16:33.05,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,could save you since we were in \Nthe supplementary class together,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:36.52,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I had no choice but to spend \Na day with you! Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:38.63,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell's the deal with this set-up
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.63,0:16:41.18,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,of a lovesick girl off in \Nfantasy land, Koiwai Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.79,0:16:45.52,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,From now on, be appreciative \Nof that, and live a quiet life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:52.82,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Wait, you rented the place out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:54.45,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Is it that surprising?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:58.91,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Man... I guess some things never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:01.99,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:03.93,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You're too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.93,0:17:05.61,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:08.97,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you so far away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:11.01,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh, she's such a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:42.54,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Man, I didn't have any \Nbackground information,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:46.45,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,but I didn't think it'd be such a \Nhorror in more ways than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:49.28,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,What did you think, Adagaki-sa—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:53.11,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,She's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:54.97,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Whitening-san is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:56.39,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.71,0:18:00.15,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, some phenomenon is \Noccurring that's draining all strength
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:03.37,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,from my knees and preventing \Nme from leaving my seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.37,0:18:06.69,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I think you're just scared stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:09.15,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't know it was a horror movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.64,0:18:12.60,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Yoshino planned everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:15.03,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly, she's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:17.48,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,So I guess getting food is out of the question?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:18.78,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:29.46,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,How can she eat so much after \Nwatching a movie like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:34.96,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, stop nonchalantly pushing \Nyour empty plates toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:38.18,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,The Cruel Princess that I know is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.63,0:18:41.95,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,much stronger, more arrogant,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:42.89,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,and at the least...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:46.19,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,She wasn't someone who could eat enough\Nlunch and dessert for three people
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.19,0:18:49.03,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,at a family restaurant while dressed \Nup as someone from {\i0}Hadapure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.07,0:18:51.39,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,This is just a hunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.39,0:18:51.98,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:56.49,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,The reason you eat so much isn't \Nsomething you were born with, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.07,0:18:59.38,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:02.45,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I think it started when something \Nawful happened in my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:04.59,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Something awful?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:07.71,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:09.42,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:13.29,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you dressed so weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:16.65,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,And she gets right to the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.95,0:19:18.94,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's not weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.94,0:19:21.51,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,This is from {\i1}I'm Hadapure{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.51,0:19:24.21,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to be Hadapure, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.21,0:19:26.31,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:30.44,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Please stop, Adagaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:34.20,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Listen up. I'm sure you don't understand \Nbecause you're still a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.53,0:19:37.70,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,but this is a necessary ritual \Nwhen a man and a woman date.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:39.24,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,"Ritual"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:41.78,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. In order to break the \Nice on the first date,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.78,0:19:44.66,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,you must wear a costu—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:45.85,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.85,0:19:47.61,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait, Makabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:54.01,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I was just getting to the good part!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:55.30,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Adagaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.49,0:19:58.77,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't find the right \Ntime to say it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.53,0:20:04.51,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,It's not normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.33,0:20:07.53,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,To think I folded from the \Nstares of everyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.53,0:20:09.75,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,rather than let a girl embarrass herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:13.98,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I see. So you don't... You don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:20.23,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,C-Come to think of it, summer clothes \Nshould be coming out about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.23,0:20:21.94,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I should check them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.94,0:20:23.78,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.65,0:20:26.75,Main,Person,0000,0000,0000,,Please try on your items over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:48.60,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Adagaki-sa—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.14,0:20:56.02,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:20:58.77,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.87,0:21:07.87,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Once upon a time, when I was \Na bullied, chubby little kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.45,0:21:12.38,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I happened to run into a \Nhuge mansion and met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:16.04,Flashback,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You need to get stronger! How pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.49,0:21:18.32,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,She didn't hold back
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:20.72,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,and was almost as hard on me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:22.80,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,as the other bullies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.30,0:21:29.57,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.21,0:21:33.32,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,The Cruel Princess I know is
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:36.40,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,much stronger, more arrogant...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.40,0:21:39.31,Flashback,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You're so kind, Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:43.72,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,...and just as kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:57.61,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're awake. I'm going home, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.59,0:22:03.21,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.04,0:22:05.24,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Adagaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.24,0:22:06.80,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.32,0:22:10.76,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I scared you back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:14.76,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You'd better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:22.42,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,That was an emotion I didn't need in my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.02,0:22:25.91,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,But I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.45,0:22:29.81,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Wouldn't you usually say,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.81,0:22:32.62,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,"No, it was my fault," there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.62,0:22:35.67,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Why would she look so smug?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.67,0:22:38.32,Italics,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,This is all for Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:40.33,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.73,0:22:44.34,Italics,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,You asked me why I was \Nhelping you, Pig's Foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.79,0:22:48.80,Italics,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I believe that Aki-sama needs \Nto reexamine herself a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.22,0:22:52.20,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,If you dump her, and that makes \Nher a little more modest,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.20,0:22:54.60,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,it greatly benefits me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.92,0:22:56.11,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,as well as Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.41,0:22:59.52,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,So that's it. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:03.60,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,But planning the lap pillow \Nwas going a bit far, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:05.72,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Lap pillow? Plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.02,0:23:08.42,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I totally almost fell for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.42,0:23:09.74,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:11.45,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:14.95,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You can't fool me, you scheming Cinderella.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.43,0:23:18.24,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I'm looking forward \Nto working with you again,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.69,0:23:20.00,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Master Koiwai.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:23.13,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,"Master"...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.69,0:23:27.66,Main,Sister,0000,0000,0000,,It's rare for you to be talking to \Nsomeone other than Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.38,0:23:32.27,Main,Sister,0000,0000,0000,,Did something fun happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:38.17,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I'm having a lot of fun.
